OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FContinuing
OL,6,Frather cloudy with patchy drizzle, but
OL,7,Fthere will be some clearer spells
OL,8,Fpossible, especially in the west where
OL,9,Fpatchy fog and perhaps a touch of
OL,10,Ffrost may develop.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FStill quite a lot of cloud
OL,13,Fthrough the day with outbreaks of
OL,14,Fmostly light drizzle, but a few
OL,15,Fbrighter spells possible at times.
OL,16,FWinds remaining light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
