OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FLittle
OL,6,Fchange, rather cloudy through into
OL,7,Fnext week, with patchy drizzle or
OL,8,Fshowers. Where any cloud breaks occur,
OL,9,Fovernight fog and frost may develop.
